# Drizzle migrations (read-only)

Never create, modify, or delete files under `src/packages/database/drizzle/migrations/` or `migrations/meta/`.

## Workflow

1. Edit schema in `src/packages/database/src/schema/` (see `postgres-column-alignment` rule).
2. Edit repositories in `src/packages/database/src/repositories/` if needed.
3. Tell the developer to review schema changes.
4. Developer runs `make migrations name=<name>` and `bun run --filter @ndb/database migrate`.

## Allowed

- Read migration files to understand current DB shape.
- Edit `src/packages/database/drizzle/seed/local.template.sql`.

## Not allowed

- Hand-written SQL under `drizzle/migrations/`
- Running migration generators (`make migrations`, drizzle-kit, etc.)

See [docs/DEV.md](../../docs/DEV.md) for setup commands.
